{"t":"Bazar","p":"Bazar","g":"Maps","html":"<div><div> <table> <tbody><tr> <td> <table> <tbody><tr> <td> <p><img alt=\"Bazar Panorama.png\" height=\"256\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/thumb/b/be/Bazar_Panorama.png/875px-Bazar_Panorama.png\" width=\"875\"/> </p> </td></tr></tbody></table> </td></tr></tbody></table></div><div> <div><table> <tbody><tr> <td colspan=\"5\"><b>Angrenzende Gebiete</b></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <ul><li><a data-w=\"Joan\">Joan</a></li> <li><a data-w=\"Pyungmoo\">Pyungmoo</a></li> <li><a data-w=\"Yongan\">Yongan</a></li></ul></td> <td>➜</td> <td><b>Bazar</b></td> <td></td> </tr> </tbody></table> </div></div> <table> <tbody><tr><td colspan=\"4\"><img alt=\"Flag neutral.png\" height=\"15\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/thumb/f/f2/Flag_neutral.png/24px-Flag_neutral.png\" width=\"24\"/> <b>Bazar</b> </td> </tr><tr> <td rowspan=\"2\"> <div><div>INFORMATIONEN</div></div> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\"> <ul><li>Der <a>Bazar</a> wurde mit dem Update in Version <b>20.5</b> eingeführt.</li> <li>Der Bazar lässt sich von den verschiedenen Reichen mithilfe der <a data-w=\"Handelsverwalterin\">Handelsverwalterin</a> für <span> <span><img alt=\"Yang.png\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/thumb/1/1d/Yang.png/22px-Yang.png\" width=\"22\"/></span></span> <a data-w=\"Yang\">5.000 Yang</a> betreten.</li> <li>Seit der Einführung vom Bazar, können nur noch hier <a data-w=\"Privater_Laden\">Private Läden</a> erstellt werden.</li> <li>Auf dem Bazar können keine Monster beschworen werden und es kann kein <a data-w=\"PvP\">PvP</a> ausgeübt werden.</li></ul> </td> <td> <div>Interaktive Karte</div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <div><div><div><div><img height=\"256\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/thumb/c/c0/Bazar_Interaktive_Karte.png/256px-Bazar_Interaktive_Karte.png\" width=\"256\"/></div> <div>Interaktive Karte</div></div></div></div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan=\"3\"> </td></tr> <tr><td colspan=\"3\"><center> <table><tbody><tr><td> <div> <div> <div> Monster</div><div> Bosse</div><div> Metins</div><div> NPCs</div><div> Erze</div><div> Karten</div> </div><div> <div><div> <p><i>Keine Monster vorhanden.</i> </p> </div></div><div><div> <p><i>Keine Bosse vorhanden.</i> </p> </div></div><div><div> <p><i>Keine Metins vorhanden.</i> </p> </div></div><div><div> <table> <tbody><tr> <td colspan=\"6\"> <center><b><a data-w=\"Alchemist_(Energie_System)\"> <span>Alchemist</span></a></b><br/> Position: 222, 185</center> </td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan=\"6\"> <div><img alt=\"Alchemist.png\" height=\"198\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/thumb/5/5b/Alchemist.png/110px-Alchemist.png\" width=\"110\"/> </div> </td> </tr> </tbody></table> <table> <tbody><tr> <td colspan=\"6\"> <center><b><a data-w=\"Gemischtwarenhändlerin\"> <span>Gemischtwarenhändlerin</span></a></b><br/> Position: 364, 318</center> </td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan=\"6\"> <div><img alt=\"Gemischtwarenhändlerin.png\" height=\"198\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/thumb/3/34/Gemischtwarenh%C3%A4ndlerin.png/64px-Gemischtwarenh%C3%A4ndlerin.png\" width=\"64\"/> </div> </td> </tr> </tbody></table> <table> <tbody><tr> <td colspan=\"6\"> <center><b><a data-w=\"Handelsverwalterin\"> <span>Handelsverwalterin</span></a></b><br/> 5x vorhanden</center> </td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan=\"6\"> <div><img alt=\"Handelsverwalterin.png\" height=\"198\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/thumb/1/18/Handelsverwalterin.png/155px-Handelsverwalterin.png\" width=\"155\"/> </div> </td> </tr> </tbody></table> <table> <tbody><tr> <td colspan=\"6\"> <center><b><a data-w=\"Lagerverwalter\"> <span>Lagerverwalter</span></a></b><br/> Position: 328, 185</center> </td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan=\"6\"> <div><img alt=\"Lagerverwalter.png\" height=\"198\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/thumb/d/d2/Lagerverwalter.png/137px-Lagerverwalter.png\" width=\"137\"/> </div> </td> </tr> </tbody></table> <table> <tbody><tr> <td colspan=\"6\"> <center><b><a data-w=\"Postfach\"> <span>Postfach</span></a></b><br/> Position: 315, 318</center> </td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan=\"6\"> <div><img alt=\"Postfach.png\" height=\"198\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/thumb/9/9f/Postfach.png/165px-Postfach.png\" width=\"165\"/> </div> </td> </tr> </tbody></table> <table> <tbody><tr> <td colspan=\"6\"> <center><b><a data-w=\"Dorfschmied\"> <span>Schmied</span></a></b><br/> Position: 222, 318</center> </td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan=\"6\"> <div><img alt=\"Schmied.png\" height=\"149\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/thumb/4/44/Schmied.png/202px-Schmied.png\" width=\"202\"/> </div> </td> </tr> </tbody></table> </div></div><div><div> <p><i>Keine Erze vorhanden.</i> </p> </div></div><div><div> <div><div><img height=\"350\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/thumb/d/d3/Bazar.png/350px-Bazar.png\" width=\"350\"/> <div>Übersichtskarte</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div> </td></tr></tbody></table> </center></td></tr></tbody></table> </div> </div>"}